Likutay Halachos — Birchas HaHodaah [The Blessing of Thanksgiving] 6, Part 4 (§§ 37–50) — COMPLETE

:root{--bg:#faf8f3;--text:#2c2418;--accent:#8b6914;--border:#d4c9a8}

*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}

body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.85;padding:2rem 1rem;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;text-align:justify}

.bt{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.3rem}

.ht{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.8rem;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border)}

.sn{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}

.p{margin-bottom:1.2rem}.v{font-style:italic;color:#4a3b1f}.h{font-style:italic;color:var(--accent)}.lr{font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}.mx{font-weight:600;color:#4a3b1f;font-style:italic}

.cn{margin-top:2.5rem;padding:1.2rem;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px;text-align:center;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--accent);line-height:1.7}

Likutay Halachos — Orach Chaim, Volume 2

Hilchos Birchas HaHodaah [The Blessing of Thanksgiving] — Halachah 6
